      "name": {
        "en": "J26 60-pin Multi Port",
        "zh-CN": "J26 60 针多功能接口"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "Pins 22–52 expose PA4–PA15, PB0–PB15 and PC0–PC2 as muxed display/peripheral GPIOs; pins 57–60 carry the touch-panel signals. Pins 1–10 are dedicated DSI differential lanes, not GPIOs. Screen reset, backlight and power enable are defined by the selected top board.",
        "zh-CN": "22–52 针引出 PA4–PA15、PB0–PB15、PC0–PC2，作为显示/外设复用 GPIO；57–60 针为触摸屏信号。1–10 针为专用 DSI 差分线，不是 GPIO。屏幕复位、背光和电源使能由所选顶板定义。"
      },
